# Sugar cube 2: two sugar cubes (kitchen_sugar), one standing and one tipped onto an edge and leaning on it: 2.3 m wide and about 1.35 m tall (60 times life
# size), a wall to both sides. Knee cover. Convex collider.
format 1
collider convex

Detail detail=0.25
    Material material=kitchen_sugar
        Union
            Translate translation=(-0.6, 0.48, 0)
                Rotate rotation=(0, 0.15, 0)
                    RoundBox size=(0.48, 0.48, 0.48) roundness=0.08
            Translate translation=(0.57, 0.6718, 0.05)
                Rotate rotation=(0, 0.1, 0)
                    Rotate rotation=(0, 0, 0.7)
                        RoundBox size=(0.5, 0.5, 0.5) roundness=0.08
